{"3809160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project Stormwatch", "steam_appid": 3809160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Kingdom is Divided</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet unrest has left Myridor on the brink of divide. A movement to topple the king is set into motion with the kidnapping of his three children - and only you can fight to bring them home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command Your Forces</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle enemy forces, build an army, and lead your faction alongside Luc and Alaric through turn-based tactical combat. The closer you grow to your companions, the greater your strength becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Relationships</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy close moments with the companions within your faction. With branching dialogue choices and an affection point system, you can choose who to keep closest to your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the Journey</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With themes of mental health, power, and survival in mind, traverse Myridor's darkest days - and witness the narrative-focused journey come to light.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Kingdom is Divided</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet unrest has left Myridor on the brink of divide. A movement to topple the king is set into motion with the kidnapping of his three children - and only you can fight to bring them home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command Your Forces</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle enemy forces, build an army, and lead your faction alongside Luc and Alaric through turn-based tactical combat. The closer you grow to your companions, the greater your strength becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Relationships</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy close moments with the companions within your faction. With branching dialogue choices and an affection point system, you can choose who to keep closest to your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the Journey</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With themes of mental health, power, and survival in mind, traverse Myridor's darkest days - and witness the narrative-focused journey come to light.</p>", "short_description": "Traverse through Myridor and stop a growing rebellion with the support of your army! Face off in strategic battles, create relationships, and discover the world through a story where every choice matters.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809160/a80bf617d09764b4d6e3dba8c0c1e5c1f2617e2b/header.jpg?t=1772914405", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809160/37dfd827a1d2605bf13373463c9b4f2f4cd01f9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772914405", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809160/37dfd827a1d2605bf13373463c9b4f2f4cd01f9b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772914405", "website": "https://project-stormwatch.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium 4415U or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 620 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Working</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers"